---
description: gworkspace MCP, chores, and Node-host live sheet. Read spreadsheetId from the package's sheets.config.json. Open docs/targets-and-gates.md and packages/framework/docs/how-it-runs.md.
globs:
  - packages/*/src/chores/**
  - packages/framework/dev/chores/**
  - packages/framework/scripts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Live-sheet command rules: [`docs/targets-and-gates.md`](../../docs/targets-and-gates.md). Hosts, chore dry run, MCP: [`how-it-runs.md`](../../packages/framework/docs/how-it-runs.md).

gworkspace MCP: `spreadsheet_id` from the package's `sheets.config.json` (`packages/real-estate/` for the app, `packages/framework/` for dev).

An `app:chore` send needs a dry run of that chore earlier in the session. Chore homes and the raw-request opening: [`architecture/chores.md`](../../packages/framework/docs/architecture/chores.md).
